OL,3,CBill Oddie, wildlife presenter and
OL,4,CGoodies star, dies aged 85
OL,6,FWildlife presenter and Goodies star
OL,7,FBill Oddie has died at the age of 85,
OL,8,Fhis agent has said.
OL,10,FOddie, who found fame in the 1970s as
OL,11,Fa member of comic trio The Goodies
OL,12,Falongside Tim Brooke-Taylor and Graeme
OL,13,FGarden, died on Saturday.
OL,15,FHe went on to host programmes for the
OL,16,FBBC, including Birding With Bill
OL,17,FOddie, Bill Oddie Goes Wild,
OL,18,FSpringwatch and Autumnwatch.
