OL,3,CBill Oddie, wildlife presenter and
OL,4,CGoodies star, dies aged 85
OL,6,FA statement from his friend and agent
OL,7,FDavid Foster said: "It is with deep
OL,8,Fsadness that I announce the passing of
OL,9,FBill Oddie, the country's best-loved
OL,10,Fbirder.
OL,12,F"Bill was a multi-talented celebrity -
OL,13,Fwildlife presenter, broadcaster,
OL,14,Fcomedian, writer, songwriter, musician
OL,15,Fand conservationist.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@oD@TOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
