PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785178109
OL,3,CBill Oddie, wildlife presenter and
OL,4,CGoodies star, dies aged 85
OL,6,F"Yet it was never fame that he valued.
OL,7,FInstead he encouraged us to respect
OL,8,Fand protect the environment.
OL,10,F"He taught us the wonder of it. He
OL,11,Fprotested, lobbied and campaigned for
OL,12,Fit. He led the way and people of all
OL,13,Fages and backgrounds responded to his
OL,14,Fcall. And such a massive contribution
OL,15,Fto conservation will never be
OL,16,Fforgotten.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOU
