PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785178109
OL,3,CBill Oddie, wildlife presenter and
OL,4,CGoodies star, dies aged 85
OL,6,F"As Bill's agent I witnessed close
OL,7,Fhand his intelligence and wit. He was
OL,8,Fmy friend and it was an honour and a
OL,9,Fprivilege to represent him for so many
OL,10,Fyears. I will miss him terribly.
OL,12,F"My thoughts and love are with Bill's
OL,13,Fwife, Laura, and his daughters Bonnie,
OL,14,FKate and Rosie, who have asked not to
OL,15,Fbe contacted at this sad time. Please
OL,16,Frespect their wishes."
